title: rather than cycling commit readiness
pid: 216115ed-6355-483c-b8c3-e24888219cdd
body: |2-
  we should be able to act more granularly:
  - mark <node|rel|both> <processed|unprocessed>
  The key commands would be m <n|r|b> <p|u>,
  and it should still be that the C-u prefix recurses contentward,
  and C-u C-u recurses across all relationships in the owned direction.
